4	2025-07-31 08:20:02.617+02	2025-10-15 12:08:59.598+02	Land Rover Defender	3	1	2022	3000	OCTANE	21K km	25900000.00	AUTOMATIC	\N	22 Inch	Gondwana	USED	Sold	7	images/2025-08-31/defender-2021-2022-gondwanaFinal-2025-08-31-03-24-12.webp	<p>Unapologetically brutal, the war is on wheels- presenting the 2021 Land Rover Defender 110 P400 Chelsea Truck Edition. Currently available for purchase at BEG AUTOS.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Engine:</strong><br>-3.0L Ingenium Inline-6 Turbocharged&nbsp;<br>-Power: 395 HP &amp; 550 Nm Torque<br>-Transmission: 8-Speed ZF Automatic<br>-Drivetrain: All-Wheel Drive (AWD) with Terrain Response 2<br>-Driving Modes: Eco, Comfort, Grass/Gravel/Snow, Mud/Ruts, Sand, Rock Crawl, Wade</p>\r\n<p><strong>Exterior Features:</strong><br>-Gondwana Bronze Body with Contrast Black Roof<br>-Kahn Design Chelsea Wide Truck Body Kit<br>-22-inch OEM Black Alloy Wheels with Red Brake Calipers<br>-Chelsea Truck Co. Spare Wheel Cover with Bold &ldquo;110&rdquo; Branding<br>-LED Matrix Headlights with Signature Daytime Running Lights<br>-Side-Mounted Land Rover Adventure Box<br>-Quad Black-Tip Exhaust System<br>-Gloss Black Contrast Elements (Fenders, Door Handles, Roof Rails)<br>-Fixed Side Steps &amp; Rear Privacy Glass</p>\r\n<pre><strong>Interior Features:</strong><br>-Ebony Windsor Leather Upholstery<br>-7 Passenger capacity<br>-10-inch Pivi Pro Infotainment Touchscreen with Navigation<br>-Meridian Premium Audio System<br>-12.3-inch Interactive Driver Display<br>-Heated Front Seats with 12-Way Power Adjustment<br>-Twin-Zone Automatic Climate Control<br>-Panoramic Fixed Glass Roof<br>-Configurable Ambient Lighting</pre>\r\n<p><strong>Safety Features:</strong><br>-6 Airbags (Front, Side, Curtain)<br>-360&deg; Surround Camera with ClearSight Ground View<br>-Adaptive Cruise Control with Stop &amp; Go<br>-Lane Keep Assist &amp; Blind Spot Monitoring<br>-Autonomous Emergency Braking (AEB)<br>-Hill Descent Control &amp; Roll Stability Control</p>	PUBLIS